	<div class="col-sm-12">
		<h2>GS Series Airless Sprayers</h2>
		<p>
			The GS Series paint sprayers give you versatility when power is not available.
			These gas airless paint sprayers combine the proven durability of the &quot;Slow Stroker&quot;
			paint pump, with a dependable Honda gas engine. Ideal for new construction or those
			big jobs where mobility is a necessity. Honda engines are CARB/EPA certified and include
			oil alert engine protection if the oil level is low. Each sprayer comes with a 2-year
			Advantage Protection warranty with a one time piston and packing allowance. Lifetime
			coverage on cylinder (body) and gearbox.
		</p>
	</div>

	<div class="col-sm-3">
		<img alt="GS800 gas sprayer" src="~/images/products/GS800.jpg">
	</div>

	<div class="col-sm-9">
		<h3>GS800</h3>
		<p>
			The GS800 is ideal for large residential projects, commercial and industrial use.
			It is able to spray Water and oil-based coatings, 100% acrylics, multi-color, stain,
			sealer, varnish and lacquer . The GS800 is rated to spray approximately 10,000 gallons
			of paint per year, which is ideal for the large contractor.
		</p>
		<b>Features:</b>
		<ul>
			<li>Electronic sensing pressure control</li>
			<li>Honda GX160 engine with a 2-year warranty and oil alert engine protection</li>
			<li>Stainless steel piston and pump body</li>
			<li>Exclusive triple-life externally adjustable packings</li>
			<li>Oversized high-pressure filter</li>
			<li>
				Unit comes complete with 1/4 in x 50 ft [6.4 mm x 15 m] Hose, 2 ft [.6 m] Whip
				Hose, 500 Series Gun, and 517 Uni-Tip Spray Tip
			</li>
		</ul>

	</div>

