	<div class="col-sm-12">
		<h3>HSS Series Airless Sprayers</h3>
		<p>
			The Airlessco HSS Series is designed with the features painters have come to
			expect while raising the bar in hydraulic and paint pump performance. In addition
			to increased paint pump performance, we substantially enhanced durability. The
			HSS Series is offered with a variety of available power options that let you take
			advantage of the greater performance and value potential.
		</p>
	</div>

	<div class="col-sm-3">
		<img alt="HSS9000 gas airless sprayer" src="~/images/products/HS9000.jpg">
	</div>

	<div class="col-sm-9">
		<h3>HSS9000</h3>
		<p>
			The HSS9000 is a great sprayer for large commercial projects and heavy
			industrial use. It is able to spray water and oil-based coatings, 100% acrylics,
			multi-color, block filler, elastomerics, dry fall, mastics, epoxy, intumescent
			coatings, roof coatings. The HSS9000 is rated to spray approximately 30,000
			gallons of paint per year, which is ideal for the large contractor.
		</p>
		<b>Features:</b>
		<ul>
			<li>Easily pumps heavy bodied coatings</li>
			<li>Slow stroking design for long life</li>
			<li>Less frequent maintenance for reduced operating costs and down time</li>
			<li>Larger inlet seat results in higher flow</li>
			<li>
				Long pump is submerged in material – allowing heavy materials to be
				sprayed
			</li>
			<li>Oversized hydraulic pump for long life</li>
			<li>Large capacity reservoir keeps the system cool</li>
			<li>Lower operating temps for reduced friction and wear</li>
			<li>Pump assembly swivels up and locks for easy service access or storage</li>
			<li>Belt guard pivots open for easy removal of engine</li>
		</ul>
	</div>

